\cf1\f0\fs22 BOB voice assistant\par
\par
This installer sets up BOB for the current Windows user. It will:\par
\par
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}Download Ollama on this PC if it is not already installed (left in place if you later remove BOB)\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Install BOB into %LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Bob\ (Python 3.12 and Python packages are downloaded on this PC if needed)\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Let you choose a listen shortcut, an AI model that fits your GPU, and whether BOB starts with Windows\par
{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Download the selected Ollama model and speech models\par
\par
BOB works best with an NVIDIA GPU (~10 GB VRAM). You must already have GPU drivers installed.\par
}
